# Mobile project structure

App lives in `apps/mobile` (Expo + TypeScript). Shared contracts in `packages/shared`; HTTP in `packages/api-client`.

## Do

- Put screens under `src/components/screens/`
- Put reusable controls under `src/components/base/`
- Put navigation under `src/components/navigation/`
- Put Zustand stores under `src/stores/`
- Put theme under `src/theme/`

## Do not

- Import MQTT or IR libraries in the app
- Call `fetch` from components or screens
- Add Expo Router in the MVP
- Duplicate `AirState` / mode unions — import from `@smart-ac/shared`
- Commit `.env` with real `API_SECRET` or LAN URLs with credentials

## Config

- `EXPO_PUBLIC_API_BASE_URL` — e.g. `http://127.0.0.1:3000` or LAN IP of the machine running the backend
- `EXPO_PUBLIC_API_SECRET` — same value as backend `API_SECRET` (dev only; rotate for production)
